  message: "Done in PR #2291 (dev 703dce32b; commit 458aa5f15, residuals in 54f775324). Re-checked on dev 703dce32b: (1) grep -rnE \"[\\\"']hg(stableid|shapeid|repofp|scipid|fp|standinfp)[0-9]+:\" packages/*/tests tests --include=*.py, excluding test_behavior_map_schema.py -> 0 lines (was 506 lines in 97 files); 100 test files build pins from STABLE_ID_PREFIX / SHAPE_ID_PREFIX / REPO_FINGERPRINT_PREFIX / SYMBOL_FINGERPRINT_PREFIX. (2) python: fingerprint._SCHEME_PREFIX == 'hgfp2:' and 'is identity_schemes.SYMBOL_FINGERPRINT_PREFIX' -> True, == value_label('fp', SYMBOL_FINGERPRINT_SCHEME) -> True; no \"hgfp2:\" string literal left in fingerprint.py. (3) scripts/smart-test over test_identity_schemes.py (incl. the new gate test_no_file_writes_an_identity_label_out) + 5 more files -> mypy ratchet clean, 138 passed. Bump property observed: the v16 bump 54f775324 edited 2 hand pins only (both in test_behavior_map_schema.py). Left as the item recorded: slice.py 'sha256:' feature id, analyze/base.py _NESTED_ID_HASH_LABEL frozen text, and the optional 0.21.1 schema bump for scip_stable_id_scheme (owner option, not taken). Evidence: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/fast_smart_test_build_11172026/closure_pr3/jozil.txt, ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/fast_smart_test_build_11172026/closure_pr3/smarttest_core.txt"  # ef02
